msgstr "Physical layer transmit pipeline — TXS-10002-2025 standard 6.10"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/tx_pipeline.py:9
msgid "将 MAC 层载荷经过 CRC → 码块分割 → Polar 编码 → 加扰 → 帧组装 → 调制, 输出可用于发射的基带 IQ 信号。"
msgstr ""
"Processes MAC layer payload through CRC → code block segmentation → Polar "
"encoding → scrambling → frame assembly → modulation, outputting a baseband "
"IQ signal ready for transmission."

